## Why This Is Asked

Tests understanding of data privacy, per-tenant isolation, and practical use of GCP data tools in a beginner-friendly setup.

## Key Concepts

- Data masking in streaming + Data Catalog lineage
- Per-tenant isolation with BigQuery datasets
- Rollback using backup tables and views
- Schema drift handling and late data tolerance

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-Dataflow DoFn masking PII
class MaskPiIFn extends DoFn {
  processElement(ctx) {
    const record = ctx.element;
    record.email = mask(record.email);
    record.phone = mask(record.phone);
    return record;
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you test data contracts in Data Catalog?
- How would you scale this pattern to 10s of tenants?

## Why This Is Asked
Understanding end-to-end streaming ingestion, privacy handling, and basic rollback in GCP.

## Key Concepts
- Pub/Sub streaming
- Dataflow DoFn masking
- BigQuery per-tenant datasets
- Data Catalog data contracts and lineage
- Quarantine path and 24h rollback

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo Dataflow DoFn: mask PII before write
class MaskPIIFn {
  process(element) {
    // element is a JSON object
    if (element.email) element.email = maskEmail(element.email);
    if (element.phone) element.phone = maskPhone(element.phone);
    return element;
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test this pipeline for schema drift and masking correctness?
- How would you alert on quarantine volume spikes and auto-remediate?
